1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,150
You're switched off.

2
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:02,200
If you're off,

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,210
why is the water

4
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,075
still running?

5
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:05,930
Pump filled me earlier.

6
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,160
Now gravity keeps

7
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,050
the water moving.

8
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:09,930
My water level is higher

9
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,100
than those taps.

10
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,830
You're a giant waiting room

11
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:14,540
for water.

12
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,080
A useful one.

13
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,130
But my level falls

14
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,125
as water leaves.

15
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,410
Which is why somebody

16
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:21,460
has to refill you.

17
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:23,910
There you go.

18
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,638
Teamwork.

19
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,950
I'm supervising.
